IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `bsma-owner`

-- Building (Strata Management) Act 2004, ss 30, 31, 32, 37, 37A, 40, 41, 43, 44, 47, 53, 54, 63, 65, 111, 120, 128, First Schedule para 2 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_building-strata-management-act-2004_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

