§ `ss 37, 37A, 111 -- improving my lot`

#ASSERT `What do I need before I make this improvement` `window grilles` EQUALS `no authority: section 37A permits it despite any by-law`
#ASSERT `What do I need before I make this improvement` `enclosing the balcony` EQUALS `a 90% resolution authorising it, and planning permission if the Planning Act requires it`
#ASSERT `What do I need before I make this improvement` `new window frames in a different colour` EQUALS `the management corporation's authority under section 37(4)`
#ASSERT `What do I need before I make this improvement` `re-tiling the kitchen` EQUALS `no authority under section 37`

#ASSERT `Have I met my duties in installing safety equipment` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Have I met my duties in installing safety equipment` TRUE TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `May the management corporation authorise my improvement under section 37(4)` TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT `Can a Board order the management corporation to consent to my improvement` `new window frames in a different colour` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Can a Board order the management corporation to consent to my improvement` `enclosing the balcony` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Can a Board order the management corporation to consent to my improvement` `new window frames in a different colour` TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT `Can I be made to undo an unauthorised improvement at my own cost` TRUE TRUE

#ASSERT NOT `Can the management corporation recover from me the cost of remedial work it did` TRUE TRUE FALSE

§ `s 32 -- by-laws`

#ASSERT NOT `Can a by-law stop or restrict me doing this` `let it out on a tenancy`
#ASSERT `Can a by-law stop or restrict me doing this` `keep a pet`

§ `ss 40, 41 -- contributions`

#ASSERT `What is my share of the contributions` `an ordinary levy` EQUALS JUST 1200
#ASSERT `What is my share of the contributions` `a levy before the TOP` EQUALS JUST 300
#ASSERT `What is my share of the contributions` `a levy after a TOP for any lot in the building` EQUALS JUST 1200
#ASSERT `What is my share of the contributions` `a levy by comprehensive resolution` EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `Does my unpaid contribution bear interest` 31 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Does my unpaid contribution bear interest` 30 FALSE

#ASSERT `Have I committed the offence of not paying after a written demand` TRUE NOTHING 14
#ASSERT NOT `Have I committed the offence of not paying after a written demand` TRUE (JUST 13) 20
#ASSERT `Have I committed the offence of not paying after a written demand` TRUE (JUST 14) 20
#ASSERT NOT `Have I committed the offence of not paying after a written demand` TRUE NOTHING 13

#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for not paying after a written demand` 30 EQUALS 13000

§ `ss 40(3), (4), 47 -- buying and selling`

#ASSERT `As the buyer, am I liable with the seller for the arrears` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `As the buyer, am I liable with the seller for the arrears` TRUE TRUE

#ASSERT NOT `As the seller, am I still liable for this contribution` FALSE

#ASSERT `By which day after my application must I be allowed to inspect` FALSE EQUALS JUST 21

§ `s 43 -- charge and sale`

#ASSERT `Can my arrears become a charge on my lot` `31 days after the demand`
#ASSERT NOT `Can my arrears become a charge on my lot` `30 days after the demand`

#ASSERT `Can the management corporation sell my lot` `every step taken for a sale`
#ASSERT NOT `Can the management corporation sell my lot` `the sale only 42 days after publication`
#ASSERT NOT `Can the management corporation sell my lot` `no special resolution`
#ASSERT NOT `Can the management corporation sell my lot` `paid after publication`
#ASSERT NOT `Can the management corporation sell my lot` `a court action pending`

#ASSERT NOT `Am I entitled to a discharge of the charge` TRUE TRUE

§ `s 44 -- guarantee`

#ASSERT `What is the most I can be made to pay on the management corporation's debt` 500_000 TRUE 10 1_000 EQUALS 5000

§ `First Schedule para 2, s 65(9) -- voting`

#ASSERT `Will my vote at the general meeting count` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Will my vote at the general meeting count` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Will my vote at the general meeting count` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE

